    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Candidate single-Spark vLLM profile from MiaAI-Lab's Laguna-S-2.1-DGX-Spark-RTX-6000-PRO at 750a52ea: the exact 826aacdf Laguna S 2.1 NVFP4 checkpoint with the exact b3b5921a Laguna S 2.1 DFlash NVFP4 speculative draft (7 tokens), vLLM 0.25.1 with FlashInfer attention, 256K context, 4 sequences, reasoning and tool parsing. Upstream ships no container: the image is the digest-pinned official vLLM v0.25.1 image with upstream's FlashInfer 0.6.15.dev20260712 nightly wheels baked in at build time instead of installed at every start. Upstream code has no licence file; the target model is OpenMDW-1.1 and the draft repository declares no licence. Upstream claims (not measured here) a ~15 minute first start and its own decode-throughput chart. Physical Spark acceptance is pending. Upstream's RTX 6000 PRO variant is not covered. Reasoning by default is chosen per request (chat template kwargs or sampling parameters), not as a recipe option; server default: Upstream default: enable_thinking true.",
